    {
      "text": "Stir water and sugar together in a saucepan until sugar dissolves. Add lemon, cloves, and cinnamon stick; bring simple syrup to a boil and cook until flavors combine, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LK6AbacifxLySxnjE_uitXVgTik=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-235298-hot-mulled-wine-VAT-step-02-d583bfaa151343e2a1a55397513aa912.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235298/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain simple syrup; discard lemon, cloves, and cinnamon stick. Return simple syrup to the saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lXWItNsAfkGhg_9xsWspX0MSWQM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-235298-hot-mulled-wine-VAT-step-03-1acf554b1d5d472fb4e8217cb15a3695.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235298/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir wine into simple syrup; heat until hot but not boiling, 5 to 10 minutes.",
